stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> PREPARING
 PREPARING --> PINNED: ресурс и precheck
 PREPARING --> ABORTED: подтверждённый отказ
 PINNED --> FROZEN: fencing и checkpoint
 FROZEN --> VERIFIED: proof B
 VERIFIED --> PROMOTED: новое writerEpoch
 PROMOTED --> ROUTED: readback маршрута
 ROUTED --> READY_TO_SHUTDOWN: проверки и задания
 PINNED --> BLOCKED: неизвестный freeze
 FROZEN --> BLOCKED: timeout replication
 VERIFIED --> BLOCKED: неизвестный promote
 BLOCKED --> ABORTED: CAS abort подтвердил A
 BLOCKED --> PROMOTED: readback подтвердил B
 BLOCKED --> FROZEN: readback подтвердил freeze
 PROMOTED --> DEGRADED: route не готов
 DEGRADED --> ROUTED: route восстановлен
 READY_TO_SHUTDOWN --> [*]
 ABORTED --> [*]
